# pyRevit Toolbar Specification

This is the firm-owned toolbar registry. Register every tool you add here
before creating its folder, using the same fenced `yaml` blocks as the
generated sample in `docs/toolbar/spec.d/` (managed; do not edit).

Validators read this file together with every `docs/toolbar/spec.d/*.md`
fragment. Each tool also needs a guide at `docs/toolbar/tools/<id>.md`.

Example (remove the leading `#` characters to activate it):

```text
# ```yaml
# tools:
#   - id: room-renumber
#     display_name: Room Renumber
#     type: PushButton
#     category: annotation
#     risk: Medium
#     lifecycle_stage: sandbox
#     description: Renumbers rooms along a picked path.
#     source_path: extensions/<Extension>.extension/<Tab>.tab/Studio.panel/RoomRenumber.pushbutton
# ```
```
